+| 0x68 | 72 | LC_SEGMENT_64 `__DATA` | vmaddr 0x100004000, fileoff 0x4000 |
+| 0xB0 | 80 | LC_DYSYMTAB | 18 uint32 fields (see relocations) |
+| 0x100 | 32 | LC_LOAD_DYLINKER | name at +12: `/usr/lib/dyld` |
+| 0x120 | 24 | LC_UUID | `00112233-4455-6677-8899-aabbccddeeff` |
+
+## Relocation and Loader Record Annotation
+
+- LC_DYSYMTAB carries the loader's relocation tables: `extreloff=0x2000`,
