+  LC_DYLD_INFO, which this minimal fixture intentionally omits.
+- LC_LOAD_DYLINKER names the loader record: the kernel maps the executable,
+  then hands control to `/usr/lib/dyld`, which walks segments, applies
+  relocations, binds symbols, and jumps to the entry point.
+- LC_UUID uniquely identifies the build for symbolication and cache lookups.
+
+## Parser
+
+`macho_parser.py` is a complete standard-library-only parser
+(`struct`, `uuid`, `subprocess`) with a builder that emits the fixture
